WEBVTT

00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:15,460
Okay, some questions that came in. My wife gets warm sometimes hot at night. Is that okay?

00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:19,220
Yes, that's normal. Your bulb is going to get very hot.

00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:24,580
That's why the new bulbs have a little hole in the plastic to let that out.

